studioNote: "The printed tri-fold: the cafe prints this black & white one (the colour version was archived 2026-10-09). Print duplex, flip on SHORT edge, then letter-fold: right third in first, left third over it. Sheet 1 left-to-right is tuck flap / back cover / front cover; the cover doubles as a flyer (hours, address, phone, both links). Breakfast and the drinks are on the tuck flap, so they are what a customer reads the instant the cover lifts; the inside sheet is lunch. Every colour is ink and the cover title is set in type. The GF/V marks are drafted from ingredient lists, not confirmed by the kitchen, and the proof says so in red until `dietsConfirmed` is set."
